Here is some sample Ruby code to get started:
```
@components = [
  {
    name: 'User Input',
    response_time: 0.5,
    dependencies: []
  },
  {
    name: 'Intent Recognition',
    response_time: 1.2,
    dependencies: [
      {
        component: 'User Input',
        type: 'input'
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    name: 'Query Processing',
    response_time: 2.5,
    dependencies: [
